The large-file seek needs no system call numbers here: off_t is 64 bits
wide, so ext2fs_llseek() is plain lseek() (the SIZEOF_OFF_T >= 8 branch),
and the libc has no <linux/unistd.h> to declare the numbers it would not
use.

